    {
      "number": "555",
      "text": "\u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u79ef\u7684\u7cfb\u6570\uff1a\n1) $8m\\cdot7$\uff1b\n2) $-4\\cdot(-12x)$\uff1b\n3) $-2p\\cdot(-1.4)$\uff1b\n4) $6c\\cdot(-7)$\uff1b\n5) $a\\cdot2.5b$\uff1b\n6) $0.8m\\cdot4x$\uff1b\n7) $-2.5m\\cdot(-3a)$\uff1b\n8) $-0.11x\\cdot(-2m)$\uff1b\n9) $-2.7ab\\cdot(-1)$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "556",
      "text": "\u8bf4\u51fa\u4e0b\u5217\u548c\u7684\u6bcf\u4e2a\u52a0\u6570\u548c\u52a0\u6570\u7684\u7cfb\u6570\uff1a\n1) $-8a+x-7a-x$\uff1b\n2) $m+2k-3k+4k$\uff1b\n3) $7.2ab-ab+ab+9.3ab$\uff1b\n4) $-pk+1.5pk-9pk+pk$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "557",
      "text": "\u5316\u7b80\uff1a\n1) $-a\\cdot(-b)$\uff1b\n2) $-3m\\cdot(-8k)$\uff1b\n3) $5a\\cdot(-6b)$\uff1b\n4) $4\\cdot(-2x)\\cdot(-3y)$\uff1b\n5) $-5\\cdot(-3m)\\cdot2n$\uff1b\n6) $-6a\\cdot5k\\cdot(-10)$.",
